msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Alur kerja"

msgid ""
"Record-triggered workflow rules with field conditions, immediate actions "
"(update field, assign task, email, notification), and time-based triggers "
"scheduled relative to record or rule dates."
msgstr ""
"Aturan alur kerja yang dipicu rekaman dengan kondisi bidang, tindakan "
"langsung (perbarui bidang, penetapan tugas, email, pemberitahuan), dan "
"pemicu berbasis waktu yang dijadwalkan relatif terhadap tanggal rekaman atau"
" aturan."

msgid ""
"Re-raise HttpNotFound with exception chaining in workflow detail views to "
"preserve context."
msgstr ""
"Naikkan kembali HttpNotFound dengan rangkaian pengecualian dalam tampilan "
"detail alur kerja untuk mempertahankan konteks."

msgid ""
"Migrated workflow execution engine transaction imports from django.db to "
"horilla.db."
msgstr ""
"Impor transaksi mesin eksekusi alur kerja yang dimigrasi dari Django.db ke "
"horilla.db."

msgid ""
"Migrated signal imports to the horilla.db.models.signals shim and "
"standardized first-party import groups; behavior unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Impor sinyal yang dimigrasikan ke shim horilla.db.models.signals dan grup "
"impor pihak pertama yang distandarisasi;perilaku tidak berubah."

msgid ""
"Workflow automation engine: WorkflowRule / WorkflowCondition / "
"WorkflowAction models, dynamic condition evaluation, immediate dispatch on "
"record saves, Celery WorkflowTimeTriggerAction and "
"ScheduledWorkflowExecution, execution history modal, FilterSet support, "
"auto-registration for workflow-enabled models via feature registration (e.g."
" users, departments, holidays), modular views, hidden-field action "
"configuration fixes, restored workflow detail pages, and improved routing "
"namespaces."
msgstr ""
"Mesin otomatisasi alur kerja: model WorkflowRule / WorkflowCondition / "
"WorkflowAction, evaluasi kondisi dinamis, pengiriman segera pada penyimpanan"
" catatan, Celery WorkflowTimeTriggerAction dan ScheduledWorkflowExecution, "
"modal riwayat eksekusi, dukungan FilterSet, registrasi otomatis untuk model "
"yang mendukung alur kerja melalui registrasi fitur (misalnya pengguna, "
"departemen, hari libur), tampilan modular, perbaikan konfigurasi tindakan "
"bidang tersembunyi, halaman detail alur kerja yang dipulihkan, dan ruang "
"nama perutean yang ditingkatkan."

msgid ""
"WorkflowRuleForm aligned with HorillaModelForm layout: field_order, "
"Meta.fields = \"__all__\", and keep_on_form for is_active; action forms "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"WorkflowRuleForm selaras dengan tata letak HorillaModelForm: field_order, "
"Meta.fields = \"__all__\", dan keep_on_form untuk is_active;bentuk tindakan "
"tidak berubah."

msgid ""
"Initial release: workflow rules per ContentType with create/edit triggers, "
"AND/OR conditions, ordered immediate actions, time-trigger actions with "
"Celery scheduling and execution history, Settings → Automations → Workflow "
"Rules, and integration with registered models via feature registration."
msgstr ""
"Rilis awal: aturan alur kerja per ContentType dengan pemicu buat/edit, "
"kondisi DAN/ATAU, tindakan segera yang diurutkan, tindakan pemicu waktu "
"dengan penjadwalan Celery dan riwayat eksekusi, Pengaturan → Otomatisasi → "
"Aturan Alur Kerja, dan integrasi dengan model terdaftar melalui registrasi "
"fitur."

